  <dt>Geltungsbereich</dt>
  <dd>Public-facing marketing site and authenticated customer portal.</dd>
  <dt>Methodik</dt>
  <dd>Automated axe-core 4.x scan across 24 representative routes plus manual VoiceOver keyboard-only spot check on the top 8 task flows.</dd>
</dl>
<div class="summary-stats" aria-label="Konformitätsübersicht">
<div class="summary-cell status-supports"><span class="summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="summary-count">2</span><span class="summary-key">Supports</span><span class="summary-pct">50.0%</span></div><div class="summary-cell status-partial"><span class="summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◐</span><span class="summary-count">1</span><span class="summary-key">Partially</span><span class="summary-pct">25.0%</span></div><div class="summary-cell status-fail"><span class="summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><span class="summary-count">0</span><span class="summary-key">Does Not Support</span><span class="summary-pct">0.0%</span></div><div class="summary-cell status-na"><span class="summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">—</span><span class="summary-count">0</span><span class="summary-key">Not Applicable</span><span class="summary-pct">0.0%</span></div><div class="summary-cell status-ne"><span class="summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">?</span><span class="summary-count">1</span><span class="summary-key">Not Evaluated</span><span class="summary-pct">25.0%</span></div>
</div>
</section>
